# Proplytics DWH — Automated Workflows

Real estate data warehouse automation using **SQL Server** + **Make.com** + **Gmail**.

---

## Overview

Two automated workflows that eliminate manual work in the sales process:

| Workflow | Trigger | Action |
|----------|---------|--------|
| Workflow 1 — Customer Assignment | New customer added to `Dim_Customer` | Auto-assigns the agent with fewest customers + sends email notification |
| Workflow 2 — Deal Closure Notification | `DealStatus` updated to `Completed` in `Fact_Sales` | Sends deal summary email to manager |

---

## Architecture

```
SQL Server (localhost)
    │
    ├── Trigger fires on INSERT / UPDATE
    │
    ├── Stored Procedure selects data & builds JSON
    │
    └── Ole Automation → HTTP POST → Make.com Webhook
                                          │
                                          └── Gmail → Agent / Manager
```

---

## Database

**Database:** `ProplyticsDWH`

Key tables:
- `Dim_Customer` — Customer dimension (SCD Type 2)
- `Dim_Agent` — Agent dimension (SCD Type 2)
- `Fact_Sales` — Sales transactions

---

## Workflow 1 — Customer Assignment

### What it does
When a new customer is inserted into `Dim_Customer`, the system automatically:
1. Finds the agent with the fewest assigned customers
2. Updates `AssignedAgentKey` in `Dim_Customer`
3. Sends an email to the assigned agent with the customer's details

### Files
| File | Description |
|------|-------------|
| `01_enable_ole_automation.sql` | Enable Ole Automation Procedures in SQL Server |
| `02_add_assigned_agent_column.sql` | Add `AssignedAgentKey` column to `Dim_Customer` |
| `03_sp_AssignAgentAndNotify.sql` | Stored Procedure — assigns agent & sends webhook |
| `04_trg_CustomerInsert.sql` | Trigger — fires on every INSERT into `Dim_Customer` |
| `05_test_insert.sql` | Test INSERT to verify the workflow |

### Make.com Setup
- **Module 1:** Custom Webhook (name: `Customer Assignment`)
- **Module 2:** Gmail → Send an Email to `AgentEmail`

---

## Workflow 2 — Deal Closure Notification

### What it does
When `DealStatus` changes to `Completed` in `Fact_Sales`, the system automatically:
1. Fetches customer name, agent name, total amount, commission
2. Sends a deal summary email to the manager

### Files
| File | Description |
|------|-------------|
| `01_sp_NotifyDealClosure.sql` | Stored Procedure — fetches deal data & sends webhook |
| `02_trg_DealClosure.sql` | Trigger — fires on UPDATE when DealStatus → Completed |
| `03_test_update.sql` | Test UPDATE to verify the workflow |

### Make.com Setup
- **Module 1:** Custom Webhook (name: `Deal Closure`)
- **Module 2:** Gmail → Send an Email to Manager

---

## Prerequisites

- SQL Server (any edition) with Ole Automation enabled
- Make.com account (Free or paid)
- Gmail account connected to Make.com via OAuth

---

## Setup Order

```
1. Run 01_enable_ole_automation.sql
2. Run 02_add_assigned_agent_column.sql   (Workflow 1 only)
3. Create Make.com Webhooks and copy URLs
4. Run Stored Procedure scripts (update Webhook URLs inside)
5. Run Trigger scripts
6. Test with provided test scripts
```

---

## Tech Stack

- **Database:** Microsoft SQL Server
- **Automation:** Make.com (formerly Integromat)
- **Email:** Gmail via Make.com OAuth
- **HTTP:** Ole Automation (MSXML2.ServerXMLHTTP)
